11E        │                            ; Name: get_event
           │                            ;
11E        │                            ; Routine to get a nuclear physics event
           │                            ;
11E        │                            ; Aquires data from the 4 ADCS (A, B, C, T) for all hit channels on
11E        │                            ; both PSD chips!
           │                            ;
