174        │                            ; ******* NUCLEAR PHYSICS PROGRAM *********
           │                            ;
174        │                            ; We sit in a tight loop waiting for take_event to go HIGH
174        │                            ; When posedge take_event comes along we call get_event routine.
           │                            ;
174        │                            ; We stay in get_event untill all PSD channels are read out and
174        │                            ; sent back to microblaze using the streaming FIFO.
           │                            ;
174        │                            ; We then wait for take_event to go LOW. We then go back and
174        │                            ; sit in tight loop waiting for next event!
           │                            ;
174        │                            ; led[1] is lit when we are actually in the get_event subroutine
174        │                            ; led[1] is also the busy bit i.e we are in get_event!
           │                            ;
174        │                            ; For time being let’s turn led[0] on whenever take_event is low
174        │                            ; i.e. we are just waiting for an event to come along
           │                            ;
174        │                            ;^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
174        │                   nuclear:
           │
174        │                            ; Initialize registers, ports, etc
174        │                            ; GLE: 10-Nov-2025 (modified the comment)
174        │                            ; If board id is 0 then the init routine will enable (i.e. reset) the TDC7200
174        │                            ; Init routine also now writes to CONFIG2 register by calling init_tdc
           │
